  <description>
    Static human actor mesh for simulated survivor placement. Mesh vendored
    from Gazebo Fuel (Mingfei/models/actor, "stand" skin), referenced locally
    so it works offline; held stationary via a single-pose trajectory rather
    than the original model's default walking/running patrol loop.
  </description>
</model>
